# The control-events test launcher (tests/control-events): lends its child
# an outlet ring, revokes it, and sends the child a Stop. As the ipc-test
# endpoint holder it passes the child its way to control-producer.app's
# outlet (a launcher holds what its child requests).
(Executable_Manifest
  identity => "com.cubit.control-check"
  version => "0.1.0"
  requests => [(service "process-manager" "process-manager")
               (service "ipc-test" "ipc-test")]
  may_launch => [(Launch "control-child.app")])
